{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And his sons shall stir themselves up</b> — the sons of the king of the north, for he already mentioned, \"and he shall stand for years, the king of the north.\"" "<b>And the word יתגרו</b> — like <b>ואל תתגר בם מלחמה</b> (and do not engage them in battle)." "<b>And he shall come</b> — the host of the king of the north." "<b>And shall overflow</b> — that he will bring ships to the stronghold of the king of the south."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:00.641590110Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}